      "text": "lights in the firmament … for signs … and years, Gen. 1:14 (Moses 2:14; Abr. 4:14). hallow the fiftieth year, Lev. 25:10. wander in the wilderness forty years, Num. 14:33. seventh year, the year of release, is at hand, Deut. 15:9. third year, which is the year of tithing, Deut. 26:12. neither can the number of his years be searched out, Job 36:26. thousand years in thy sight are but as yesterday, Ps. 90:4. thy years shall have no end, Ps. 102:27 (Heb. 1:12). years of thy life shall be many, Prov. 4:10. years of the wicked shall be shortened, Prov. 10:27. proclaim the acceptable year of the Lord, Isa. 61:2 (Luke 4:19). year of my redeemed is come, Isa. 63:4 (D&C 133:52).",
