      "text": "children who have arrived at the years of accountability, D&C 18:42 (20:71). rise of the Church … being one thousand eight hundred and thirty years since the coming of our Lord, D&C 20:1 (21:3). dwell in righteousness with men on earth a thousand years, D&C 29:11. when the thousand years are ended, D&C 29:22 (88:101). let them act upon this land as for years, D&C 51:17. earth during the seven thousand years of its continuance, D&C 77:6 (77:8–12; 88:108–9). priesthood … without beginning of days or end of years, D&C 84:17. give light to each other in their times and … in their years—all these are one year with God, D&C 88:44. Satan … shall not be loosed for the space of a thousand years, D&C 88:110. all the appointed days, months, and years, D&C 121:31. Savior spent about three years in his ministry among the Jews, D&C 138:25.",
